### Public API: 200
GET http://localhost:18081/public

### Missing token: 401
GET http://localhost:18081/protected

### Client credentials with permission (copy access_token from the response)
POST http://localhost:18080/realms/httpstacklens/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&client_id=composer-service&client_secret=composer-demo-secret&scope=demo%3Aread

### Valid token: 200 (replace PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN)
GET http://localhost:18081/protected
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Token with demo:read: 200; without it: 403
GET http://localhost:18081/scoped
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Client credentials without permission
POST http://localhost:18080/realms/httpstacklens/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&client_id=composer-service&client_secret=composer-demo-secret

### Invalid token: 401
GET http://localhost:18081/protected
Authorization: Bearer invalid-token

### Invalid client secret: 401
POST http://localhost:18080/realms/httpstacklens/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&client_id=composer-service&client_secret=wrong-secret
